  - m_Id: 95817750693208064
    m_Localized: 'Extra life

      obtained!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96484907638775808
    m_Localized: Save
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96496967219077120
    m_Localized: 'Skill extracted from an extremely fast demon. It allows the Guardian
      to traverse long distances, even through the air.

      

      Press <color=#FF00FF>Shift
      / RT</color> to dash.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96497047477084160
    m_Localized: 'Skill extracted from a spirit that dominates high altitudes. It
      allows the Guardian to jump while airborne.

      

      Press <color=#FF00FF>Spacebar
      / A</color> in the air to jump a second time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96497116196560896
    m_Localized: '- Double Jump -'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96497161893502976
    m_Localized: 'Amulet obtained from a legendary warrior. The Guardian becomes
      immune to all damage for a few seconds.

      

      Press <color=#FF00FF>J
      / X / LT</color> to activate the amulet.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96497225172967424
    m_Localized: '- Immunity Amulet -'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96497274061774848
    m_Localized: You obtained a <color=#FF00FF>cooldown improvement for the immunity
      amulet</color>!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96497332610064384
    m_Localized: '- Immunity Cooldown -'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96497370392354816
    m_Localized: '- Special Object -'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96497437367001088
    m_Localized: 'An old doll, in the worst of conditions. From it emanates a <color=yellow>sweet
      scent of perfume</color>, still lingering due to the uncountable days of play
      it served. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96497478399877120
    m_Localized: 'Some toy binoculars. They are covered in moss and the glasses are
      broken. After a closer inspection, you distinguish a name carved on it with
      something sharp: <color=yellow>Selene.</color>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96497528765079552
    m_Localized: "A clumsy but cute <color=yellow>portrait</color> of a little girl,
      hand drawn. A message, desperately crossed out, reads as follows: <color=yellow>\u2018From
      Iris, with love, to Selene\u2019</color>. Below it, a more recent inscription
      was angrily written: <color=yellow>\u2018WHY?\u2019</color>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
